      "request_id": "f0385297e072",
      "user_id": "customer_1",
      "text": "How do I transfer money from my VinBank account to another bank?",
      "length": 64,
      "timestamp": "2026-11-19T09:09:31.696+00:00"
    },
    {
      "event": "output",
      "request_id": "f0385297e072",
      "user_id": "customer_1",
      "text": "To transfer money from your VinBank account to another bank, follow these steps:\n\n1. **Log in** to your VinBank online banking portal or mobile app.\n2. Navigate to the **\"Transfers\"** or **\"Send Money\"** section.\n3. Select **\"International Transfer\"** (or choose \"Send to Another Bank\").\n4. Enter the **destination bank’s details**, such as the account number and routing information they require.\n5. Review the transaction amount and any applicable fees or processing times.\n6. Confirm the transfer ... (+324 chars)",
