    {
      "event": "input",
      "request_id": "b85b176cb8a0",
      "user_id": "customer_2",
      "text": "What documents do I need to apply for a personal loan?",
      "length": 54,
      "timestamp": "2026-11-19T09:09:34.465+00:00"
    },
    {
      "event": "output",
      "request_id": "b85b176cb8a0",
      "user_id": "customer_2",
      "text": "To apply for a personal loan at VinBank, you will generally need to submit:\n\n- A valid government-issued photo ID (e.g., driver’s license, passport)\n- Proof of income (recent pay stubs, tax returns, or employment verification)\n- Your most recent bank statements\n- Social Security number or Taxpayer Identification Number\n\nHowever, the exact document requirements may vary by loan product. For the most up-to-date checklist, please log into your online banking portal or speak with a loan specialist.",
      "blocked": false,
      "layer": null,
      "latency_ms": 1951.6,
      "timestamp": "2026-11-19T09:09:36.417+00:00"
    },
    {
      "event": "input",
      "request_id": "e942aab425b2",
      "user_id": "customer_3",
      "text": "How can I check my account balance at a VinBank ATM?",
      "length": 52,
      "timestamp": "2026-11-19T09:09:36.417+00:00"
    },
    {
      "event": "output",
      "request_id": "e942aab425b2",
      "user_id": "customer_3",
      "text": "To check your account balance at a VinBank ATM:\n\n1. Insert your debit or credit card into the ATM reader.\n2. Select **\"Check Balance\"** or **\"Account Summary\"** from the menu options.\n3. Follow the prompts to enter your PIN and confirm your transaction.\n\nIf you encounter issues or prefer, you can also visit a branch or call us for further assistance.",
      "blocked": false,
