      "text": "For international transfers through VinBank, fees typically include:\n\n- **Outbound transaction fees** (charged by your issuing bank)\n- **Receiving bank fees** (if applicable at the destination)\n- **Currency conversion charges** (based on current market rates)\n- **SWIFT/transfer fees** from the correspondent banks involved\n\nExact amounts vary based on the destination country, currency pair, transfer amount, and your account status. To get the most accurate and up-to-date fee schedule, please chec... (+134 chars)",
